FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">기 세대융합창업캠퍼스 홍보단</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">을 모집하오니 경북지역 대학생 및 일반인들의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; LETTER-SPACING: -0.7pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 121.6pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; TEXT-INDENT: -121.6pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체\">※ 세부내용은 첨부파일 참조.</span></p></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
